{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Is it just some kind of rare genetic anomaly? ": "",
  "I did some research, and it turns out the odds of a white crow being born is 1 in 100,000 or lower.": "",
  "On top of that, white crows generally get neglected by their parents and die young. Which only adds to their rarity.": "",
  "Damn. Even the world of crows is rough.": "",
  "Yeah. And even if they get lucky and make it to adulthood, a harsh fate awaits these survivors.": "",
  "Might be because of their different plumage, but the white crows get bullied by the others and excluded from the flock.": "",
  "That's harsh...": "",
  "It is. Even among crows, those who don't blend in are forced to live in hardship.": "",
  "Well. Where was this bird last seen?": "",
  "I'm not sure. Each of the witnesses' testimonies have it pegged to a different location.": "",
  "But all the reports agree that the crow can only be found waaaay up in the sky. Alone.": "",
  "So you'll need to go <color=keyword>somewhere with a very high vantage point</color> to find it.": "",
  "Sure, but don't you think that's going to make it difficult to get a clear shot?": "",
  "Yeah, so take a <color=keyword>super zoom lens</color> with you in order to get a clear shot.": "",
  "It'd be great if you could capture it in the center of the frame, if at all possible.": "",
  "Mmm... Sounds kinda difficult. I'll give it a shot, though.": "",
  "Great. But I want this shot against a night sky.": "",
  "At night? But why...?": "",
  "All the witnesses happened to see it at night. It seems that the white crow hides during the daytime.": "",
  "But crows aren't nocturnal, though. Are they?": "",
  "Nope. If anything, they usually sleep at night.": "",
  "But this one might have learned to hunt on its own, so as to avoid interference from the other crows.": "",
  "So it's not a lone wolf, but a lone crow.": "",
  "Well, I guess that's all I need to know. But man, I've gotta say, this sounds like a wild goose chase.": "",
  "Not goose. Crow. But I'll bump up your payment, then. Let's make it 100,000 yen and call it even? Best of luck to you now!": "",
  "(I guess I'll climb as high as I can once it gets dark out.)": "",
  "(Nice! This should be just what Hiranuma-san's looking for.)": "",
  "(Bet this would make a decent scoop.)": "",
  "(Hmm. It's kind of far, but this should work.)": "",
  "(Nice! I managed to get a good close-up of Bram-sama's face.)": "",
  "(This would make a decent scoop.)": "",
  "(Nice! I got it right in the center of the frame.)": "",
  "(Picture perfect.)": "",
  "(Ergh. I couldn't get it in the center, but I guess this should do.)": "",
  "Yagami-san. Our target is Kotatsu Higurashi, the comedian.": "",
  "He should be pulling in customers on Senryo Avenue, so try to snap a pic if you see him.": "",
  "Try to get a close-up, all right?": "",
  "Yagami-san. The target is the singer known as Bram-sama.": "",
  "He apparently picks up trash near Park Boulevard pretty often.": "",
  "I need you to get as close as you can. Thanks again.": "",
  "Make sure you wait till it's dark when searching for that white crow. It won't come out while the sun is up.": "",
  "Also, use a super zoom lens when taking that shot.": "",
  "And lastly... capture it in the center of the frame, if at all possible.": "",
  "(The top floor of Kamuro Theater has a pretty high vantage point...)": "",
  "(There's also the rooftop of that one building on Tenkaichi Street. Gotta head behind Stardust to get up there.)": "",
  "(This would be one of the higher spots in Kamurocho.)": "",
  "(Hm? Isn't that the white crow...?)": "",
  "Dang, it flew off...": "",
  "Maybe I'll stick around for a bit.": "",
  "(This isn't working. It's too far away.)": "",
  "(But at least I know where it flies around now. Tenkaichi Street should be the ideal spot to take the photo.)": "",
  "(If I recall correctly, I should be able to get to the rooftop of Stardust... but the way is a bit complicated.)": "",
  "(I think I can get on top of there from the back of the adjacent building.)": "",
  "(Hmm. This picture isn't gonna work. Lemme get another shot.)": "",
  "You must be Tanaka-san, the one who needed a PI?": "",
  "Yes. That makes you Yagami-san, I assume? I'm Fuyuhiko Tanaka. It's a pleasure to meet you.": "",
  "Likewise. So you're hoping I can find someone, is that right?": "",
  "Yes. One of my employees, actually.": "",
  "An employee?": "",
  "Yes, her name is Asami Morimiya, and she stopped showing up to work as of last week.": "",
  "I see. And I assume you've exhausted all the regular ways to get in touch with her?": "",
  "Naturally. But it seems even her friends haven't heard anything, and she hasn't been seen at home.": "",
  "Not even her parents have seen her...": "",
  "Hmm. Do you have any ideas about why she may have disappeared? Anything she may have been running from?": "",
  "Actually, she admitted to me that she had a stalker.": "",
  "Oh. That's alarming.": "",
  "Yeah. She said this guy who works for one of our clients had started harassing her...": "",
  "And what about this stalker? If he's a client, can you give me a description or any distinctive features?": "",
  "No, I'm not familiar with him myself...": "",
  "That's too bad.": "",
  "...I regretted not being able to help her.": "",
  "I'd like to meet up with her so I can apologize in person...": "",
  "I'll pay you 100,000 yen. Does that sound reasonable?": "",
  "Do you happen to have any photos of Morimiya-san? That would help me out a lot.": "",
  "Of course. Here you go.": "",
  "Oh and... I have her cell and her email. I should give those to you, too.": "",
  "(All right, let's see where this goes.)": "",
  "Hey, I'm here to pick up a package? Um... Here you go.": "",
  "Oh, sure. Just a moment.": "",
  "Here's your order, sir.": "",
  "Thank you very much, sir!": "",
  "(That'll do it for Tsukumo. Better text him.)": "",
  "Hello? Hey, I got your package.": "",
  "Thank you very much! Can you swing by Mantai?": "",
  "(All right, off to Mantai.)": "",
  "Hey, Tsukumo. Here's your package.": "",
  "Heh... Yaaasss... You have no idea how excited I've been about this!": "",
  "Hey, whatever floats your boat. But anyway, anything you have to share on your end?": "",
  "Yes, I found this person you're looking for.": "",
  "Why wouldn't she bother changing her phone? Those things are like homing beacons, man.": "",
  "Damn, you're pretty good, you know that?": "",
  "Ha! But yeah, I'm kind of a big deal.": "",
  "Anyway, it seems she's got a job at the Poppo on Shichifuku Street now.": "",
  "Oh come on, I have to go back to Poppo? What's up with this?": "",
  "Yes, you do seem to get drawn into Poppo stores quite a bit, huh? It's the Poppo curse, Yagami-shi!": "",
  "(According to Tsukumo, Morimiya-san should be here. Better start looking...)": "",
  "Hello? Tanaka-san?": "",
  "Yes, I found Morimiya-san.": "",
  "...You were getting her voicemail?": "",
  "...Well, there's nothing to worry about.": "",
  "Umm... About that. Tanaka-san, can we meet up? I think it's best I tell you in person.": "",
  "Sorry to have kept you waiting, Tanaka-san.": "",
  "(Should I really tell this guy? Something's bugging me about this...)": "",
  "(Okay, here's the plan.)": "",
  "...Hm? You know what, I can't remember for the life of me.": "",
  "Haha, my bad. Let me go refresh my memory real quick.": "",
  "(I think I need to gather my thoughts before I report back to that guy.)": "",
  "Yes, I found her working at a convenience store on Shichifuku Street.": "",
  "Yeah. It sounded like she had regrets about how quickly she quit the company.": "",
  "No problem. Thanks for doing business.": "",
  "Thank you for this, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Good to hear. Let me know if there's anything else.": "",
  "So you managed to find Asami-kun? Where is she?": "",
  "(Well, that wasn't so bad. All in all, this was a pretty easy job.)": "",
  "Hey! Are you screwing with me!?": "",
  "(I'd say I've even earned a drink.)": "",
  "Huh? A convenience store?": "",
  "(...Hm? Who could this be?)": "",
  "So she was under my nose the whole time...": "",
  "Speaking.": "",
  "No, really, thank you. I'm so relieved.": "",
  "I will. I'll be going then.": "",
  "Huh? Tanaka... san?": "",
  "She was one of my employees, actually. A woman by the name of Asami Morimiya.": "",
  "W-Wait, didn't I just report back to you about this very case?": "",
  "I-I'm sorry? This is the first time we've ever spoken, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I mean, I just told you that I found Morimiya-san...": "",
  "We just had this conversation. Didn't we?": "",
  "(What's going on here?)": "",
  "...Yes, to all three.": "",
  "Yagami-san, did the man who made this request look to be in his thirties, with dark hair?": "",
  "...Huh!?": "",
  "I finally found you, Asami-chan. I can't say it was easy.": "",
  "H-How!? How did you find out I was here!?": "",
  "Hehehe... You and I are bound by the red string of fate. Our souls are intertwined. Why run from me?": "",
  "So... Shall we adjourn to the lover's den I have prepared for us?": "",
  "Hm? You're...": "",
  "You lied to me! You stalker!": "",
  "Hmph, did you finally figure it out? And you call yourself a detective?": "",
  "Shut it! Stay away from her!": "",
  "Stay away from her? I'm sorry, Yagami-san, but Asami-chan and I are bound by the red string of—": "",
  "That's not true at all! She doesn't want to be with you!": "",
  "H-Help!": "",
  "W-What are you doing? Asami...": "",
  "Get away from him. I'm the only one who should ever be near you...": "",
  "No! I hate you!": "",
  "Can't you take a hint? Just give it—": "",
  "Go away.": "",
  "Go away, go away, go away, go away, go away, go away, go away, go away!!!": "",
  "H-Hey...": "",
  "I said, go away!": "",
  "Gueeghh... A-Asamiii...": "",
  "That's only the start of what a guy like you is gonna face in prison.": "",
  "Th-Thank you for saving me, sir...": "",
  "No, I don't deserve that. It's my fault you were in this situation in the first place.": "",
  "Nobody could have guessed he would go to such lengths, impersonating my boss and hiring you...": "",
  "Well, that should take care of that.": "",
  "Yes... What a relief.": "",
  "He apologized, and he asked if I would come back to work for the company.": "",
  "I don't see why not. The stalker situation seems resolved, after all...": "",
  "And he promised that if anything like this ever happens again, he'll do a better job standing up for me.": "",
  "Yes, she's fine. And that bastard's been handed over to the cops.": "",
  "He wants to become the kind of boss who can protect his employees.": "",
  "Yes, she is.": "",
  "Hello!? Is Asami-kun okay!?": "",
  "Oh good, what a relief. Is Asami-kun there?": "",
  "Oh. I understand.": "",
  "Would you mind if I spoke to her for a moment, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Can I ask what Tanaka-san said, Morimiya-san?": "",
  "I'd like to apologize to her directly, is all.": "",
  "Do you think you will?": "",
  "Good. That's what a good boss does.": "",
  "Um... I don't think I ever got your name...": "",
  "I'm Yagami, a private investigator.": "",
  "Well, thank you then, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Just trying to do my job, Ma'am. And on that note, I should be going.": "",
  "Hm? Okay then... Goodbye!": "",
  "Hm? Yagami-shi. What brings you here?": "",
  "I'm looking for someone, and all I've got is a phone number and an email. Think you can help me out?": "",
  "I couuuuld... But can you do something for me, first?": "",
  "I ordered a DVD box set of this anime I'm into, but I wasn't around when they delivered it...": "",
  "So now it's waiting for me at a convenience store and I've gotta go pick it up. Soooo...": "",
  "I see. How about you work your magic and I'll go get your package?": "",
  "Ah, you read my mind, Yagami-shi! It's waiting at the Poppo on Showa Street.": "",
  "Hehe, this is child's play, Yagami-shi! Here's the receipt, by the way. Key item obtained!": "",
  "Okay, whatever.": "",
  "(I guess walking across town to pick up a package is getting off light...)": "",
  "But we don't have any sway over their employees, of course. There wasn't much we could do.": "",
  "Then one day, she just didn't show up for work.": "",
  "Yeah, I meant to ask, you said you'd tried contacting her, right?": "",
  "Yes. But it always rings a few times and then goes to voicemail. And no response on email, either.": "",
  "(That would mean she still has the same cell phone, and she's probably keeping it charged...)": "",
  "(If she'd changed her number, it wouldn't even ring...)": "",
  "(But there must be a reason she's not answering. Where is she, and what is she doing?)": "",
  "(Only problem is, I don't have any warm leads... Where should I start?)": "",
  "(I guess her cell would be the best bet. If I can use that to pin down her location...)": "",
  "(But how? Who could do that...)": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san. Any news?": "",
  "Really!? That's the best possible news!": "",
  "I've kept calling her, but it just keeps going to voicemail... I was beside myself with worry.": "",
  "Yeah. If she was safe, she could have just answered her phone. Sheesh.": "",
  "So, where is she!?": "",
  "A-All right. Let's meet up at the M Side Cafe.": "",
  "Great, see you there.": "",
  "(The job's technically over once I tell Tanaka-san where Morimiya-san is...)": "",
  "(But I can't shake the feeling that something's off about this one...)": "",
  "Hello, is this Yagami, the detective?": "",
  "Well, you see, my name is Tanaka, and I'm hoping you can help me locate someone...": "",
  "And maybe a little on the pale side...": "",
  "O-Oh no! That's the man who was stalking Asami-kun!": "",
  "His name is Inamoto. He's a client of our company, and he's been harassing Asami-kun lately... ": "",
  "He's actually the son of the CEO, which made things complicated, so Asami-kun quit her job.": "",
  "This man who gave you the request... Do you know where he is now?": "",
  "(Oh shit! I fell right into his trap!)": "",
  "(Dammit, why did I tell him right where she'd be!? Morimiya-san is in danger!)": "",
  "I'm sorry Tanaka-san, I'll have to call you back!": "",
  "Huh...? H-Hey!": "",
  "(I have to get to Morimiya-san ASAP! She's probably still at the Poppo on East Shichifuku Street!)": "",
  "Um. Are you Asami Morimiya?": "",
  "Yes. I am... Who are you?": "",
  "I'm Takayuki Yagami. I'm a private investigator.": "",
  "I was hired by Fuyuhiko Tanaka to look for you.": "",
  "Wha? Tanaka-san!? My manager!?": "",
  "He hasn't been able to reach you, so he's been worried.": "",
  "...I guess I did forget to tell him that I changed my number and email.": "",
  "Wait, you changed them?": "",
  "Yes... This persistent stalker I have found them, so I had to change it.": "",
  "I see... And have you given your new contact info to anyone?": "",
  "Only my family and my best friend. With this stalker, I'm not taking any chances.": "",
  "Right, you wouldn't be able to trace who leaked it.": "",
  "But I guess I've really worried everyone, haven't I?": "",
  "Um, can I ask if Tanaka-san was mad? I left the company pretty suddenly.": "",
  "No, in fact he regretted that he couldn't help you out more.": "",
  "I see... Poor guy.": "",
  "Do I have your permission to tell Tanaka-san where to find you?": "",
  "Yes, I think I owe him an apology.": "",
  "Excellent. Thank you for trusting me.": "",
  "But... please don't tell anyone other than Tanaka-san, okay? It would be horrible if the stalker found me again.": "",
  "Of course. I'll be very discreet.": "",
  "(...That's that. Better get in touch with Tanaka-san.)": "",
  "Um, Morimiya-san? Can I ask you a question?": "",
  "You never gave Tanaka-san your new number or your new email, correct?": "",
  "Yes. That's right. I didn't.": "",
  "...Then something's fishy.": "",
  "Tanaka-san knew your current contact info.": "",
  "Really? Not my old number? I never gave him my new contacts.": "",
  "Your number is the 555 one, and your email is on softcloud, right?": "",
  "H-How!? I only told my family...": "",
  "Is it at all possible your family told him?": "",
  "I suppose it is... But would Tanaka-san really go to that length?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "That's too bad.": "น่าเสียดายจัง",
  "Thank you very much, sir!": "ขอบคุณมากครับ!",
  "Go away.": "ไปให้พ้นเลย",
  "H-Hey...": "เ-เดี๋ยวสิ...",
  "Oh. I understand.": "อ๋อ เข้าใจแล้ว"
 }
}
